{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal", "label": "ADR 0010: An empty selection is a refusal, not a zero", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-an-empty-selection-is-a-refusal.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal_empty_selection_refusal", "label": "An empty selection is a refusal, not a zero", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-an-empty-selection-is-a-refusal.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Over zero issues a share has no denominator and divide-by-zero guards (Math.max(items.length,1), ? ... : 0) return good news; the health score printed 'Needs attention (66/100)' for a page with nothing on it, which is the state the Forge build opens in. Tiles that would state a figure refuse in the tools' own words; honest nil counts keep their nil."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal_component_dropped_and_named", "label": "A composite drops an unmeasurable component and names it", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-an-empty-selection-is-a-refusal.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Delivery pace (0.34 weight) scored 0/100 for unknown sprint dates and turned Amber to Red. A component that could not be measured is dropped, survivors re-weighted, and the chip says '3 of 4 measures' with the actual weights \u2014 the no-silent-caps rule. Scoring the gap zero or a neutral 0.5 was rejected."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal_half_weight_refusal", "label": "Below half the weight the composite refuses", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-an-empty-selection-is-a-refusal.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "In points over an unestimated dataset both volume components are undefined; what survives is hygiene, which cannot carry the name 'sprint health'."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal_name_the_right_cause", "label": "The disclosure must name the right cause", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-an-empty-selection-is-a-refusal.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "'no sprint calendar' was printed for three different causes, including a calendar that was present. Three causes, three sentences. Most missing calendars were forge/src/jira.js sending no workingDays; the page now derives the day list under its own config."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal_no_data_banner_rejected", "label": "A single 'no data' banner and dimming were rejected", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-an-empty-selection-is-a-refusal.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A banner throws away what the page still knows (zero issues, which tiles already refuse for their own reasons); fading to 0.45 opacity put the only text below the AA contrast floor once tiles state their condition in words."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal", "target": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal_empty_selection_refusal", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-an-empty-selection-is-a-refusal.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal", "target": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal_component_dropped_and_named", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-an-empty-selection-is-a-refusal.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal", "target": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal_half_weight_refusal", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-an-empty-selection-is-a-refusal.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal", "target": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal_name_the_right_cause", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-an-empty-selection-is-a-refusal.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal", "target": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal_no_data_banner_rejected", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-an-empty-selection-is-a-refusal.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal", "target": "docs_adr_0007_refuse_rather_than_widen", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-an-empty-selection-is-a-refusal.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal", "target": "docs_adr_0009_one_contract_two_transports", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-an-empty-selection-is-a-refusal.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0007_refuse_rather_than_widen_refuse_rather_than_widen", "target": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal_empty_selection_refusal", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-an-empty-selection-is-a-refusal.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0010_an_e